---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Code from '../components/Code.astro';
import { business, plan, money, monthlies, offerSchema } from '../data/business';

const title = 'Pricing — Wardith';
const description =
  'Wardith pricing in plain numbers: a £250 audit, an £800 one-off Foundation setup, and ongoing monthly plans at £150 (Maintain), £400 (Grow) and £700 (Lead). No lock-ins.';

const audit = plan('audit');
const foundation = plan('foundation');
const maintain = plan('maintain');

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: business.serviceName,
  serviceType: business.serviceType,
  provider: { '@id': new URL('/#organization', Astro.site).href },
  areaServed: business.areaServed,
  description:
    'One service in three stages: a £250 audit of how AI assistants currently answer questions about your business, an £800 one-off Foundation setup that makes your business readable and credible to those systems, and ongoing monthly plans that keep you visible.',
  offers: offerSchema(),
};

// Just the offers, lifted out of the object above — the whole Service block
// would bury the prices in surrounding boilerplate.
const offersOnly = { '@type': 'Service', name: business.serviceName, offers: offerSchema() };
---
<Base title={title} description={description} schema={[serviceSchema]}>
<section class="hero hero--rules"><div class="wrap"><p class="section-label">Prices, in plain numbers</p><h1>Clarity first.<br /><em>Commitment later.</em></h1><p class="lede">Start with the {money(audit.price)} audit. Buy further work only if the findings justify it. The prices below are what you pay, with no VAT to add.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
<div class="price-block"><div class="price-grid"><div class="price-head"><p class="section-label">Start here</p><h2>Audit</h2><span class="price">{money(audit.price)} <small>one-off</small></span></div><div><h3>Know where you stand.</h3><p>A written report on what AI assistants say about your business and the evidence behind our recommendations.</p><ul class="ticks"><li>Your customers’ questions, put to the assistants repeatedly.</li><li>The answers recorded, including which businesses get mentioned.</li><li>Checks of your website and business facts across public sources.</li><li>Clear priorities, including whether further work is worth buying.</li></ul><p class="micro">Your report arrives within two working days of scope and payment being confirmed.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="price-block"><div class="price-grid"><div class="price-head"><p class="section-label">If the audit identifies a need</p><h2>Foundation</h2><span class="price">{money(foundation.price)} <small>one-off</small></span></div><div><h3>Fix the issues on your existing site.</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>Access for AI crawlers.</li><li>Structured, machine-readable business information.</li><li>Consistent business facts across the web.</li><li>Two permanent answer pages, chosen from the audit findings.</li></ul><details class="disclose"><summary>Scope and timing</summary><p>If your biggest issue falls outside this work, the audit says so. We respond within two working days of your payment clearing with a plan and a date. Delivery depends on website access and the information needed; we tell you what we’re waiting for.</p></details></div></div></div>
<div class="price-block"><div class="price-grid"><div class="price-head"><p class="section-label">Optional monthly work</p><h2>Ongoing</h2><span class="price">{money(maintain.price)} <small>per month, from</small></span></div><div><h3>Keep checking as the answers change.</h3><p>Choose how much ground to cover and how many new pages to add. Plans roll month to month, with no minimum term.</p></div></div><ul class="levels"><li class="level"><span class="level-name">Maintain</span><p>Ten customer questions, asked five times each per assistant every month. A written record of appearances and gaps, with business facts kept current and corrected when they drift.</p><span class="level-price">{money(monthlies[0].price)}/mo</span></li><li class="level"><span class="level-name">Grow</span><p>Everything in Maintain across fifteen questions. One new permanent answer page each month, focused on a gap in your visibility.</p><span class="level-price">{money(monthlies[1].price)}/mo</span></li><li class="level"><span class="level-name">Lead</span><p>Twenty-five questions checked each month, two new answer pages, and a quarterly written review of the competitors being named ahead of you and why.</p><span class="level-price">{money(monthlies[2].price)}/mo</span></li></ul><details class="disclose"><summary>Changing or cancelling your plan</summary><p>Tell us before your next payment date and there won’t be one. The month already paid for runs to its end; part-months aren’t refunded. You can also move between levels. Permanent pages remain yours.</p></details></div>
<details class="disclose"><summary>Inspect the machine-readable prices</summary><Code caption="The same prices in structured data" label="Wardith pricing JSON-LD" data={offersOnly} /></details>
</div></section>
</Base>
